5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's begin. We need to be logical to find the werewolf. I suggest we all share our thought processes clearly so we can spot any inconsistencies.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay, a mystery game! I'm gonna find the wolf first! Maybe the wolf is someone who talks too much? Or maybe someone who's too quiet? Teehee!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Calm down, Sakura. Observation is key. We should focus on how people react to accusations and whether their logic remains consistent over time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. A calm approach is best. I will listen carefully to everyone's words and try to find the truth.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! This sounds like a big adventure! I'll do my best to help us find the bad guy. Let's all work together and be friends!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Sakura, your enthusiasm is fine, but let's avoid guessing based on personality alone. We need evidence. @Toshio, do you have a specific strategy for observation?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, Mizuki is so serious! Maybe the wolf is just pretending to be serious to trick us! Right, Kenji? Let's play a game of hide-and-seek with the wolf!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should monitor who tries to lead the conversation and who tries to deflect. The Possessed will likely try to protect the Werewolf subtly.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,That is a valid point. The relationship between the Werewolf and the Possessed is the most dangerous part of this game.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not pretending! I just want us all to win! I'll watch everyone really closely, like a detective! This is so exciting!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, since you agree with Toshio, I'll be watching your synergy. If you two align too perfectly, it might be a red flag.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a secret alliance! How spicy! Maybe I'll just close my eyes and pick someone randomly! That would be a funny way to find the wolf, wouldn't it?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Randomness is a luxury we cannot afford. We must rely on the Seer's information once it surfaces, though we must be careful of fake Seers.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand. I will remain objective. I have no intention of forming an alliance, only seeking the most logical conclusion.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Don't be so mean to each other! I'm sure everyone is being honest. But if someone is lying, I'll be the first to say ""Aha!""","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's keep this level of scrutiny. Tomorrow, we will see if anyone's behavior shifts after the first night. I'm ready for the first vote.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready too! I hope the wolf is someone funny! I'll be watching everyone with my super-duper detective eyes! Bye-bye for now!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I will spend the night analyzing the patterns. Let us hope the truth reveals itself clearly tomorrow.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will do the same. I wish us all a peaceful night.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! Sleep tight! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! Let's do our best!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
