32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The first day has arrived. If the Seer has information, they may choose to reveal it or hint at it. Does anyone have anything to report?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, I had a dream! I dreamed that someone here was wearing a fuzzy wolf hat! But I can't remember who it was... maybe it was Mizuki? Just kidding!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, jokes are distracting. We should look for contradictions. For instance, if someone claims to be the Seer but their information is vague.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We should prioritize concrete information over intuition or dreams. Let's see if anyone is acting suspiciously defensive.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not defensive! I'm just happy to be here! I didn't see anything weird, but I'm ready to help find the wolf!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, your reaction was a bit fast. It's not a contradiction, but it's a pattern. @Toshio, do you suspect anyone based on yesterday's talk?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe Kenji is just excited! Or maybe he's the wolf and he's trying to act like a little kid! Wait, I'm the little kid! Teehee!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I find Kenji's over-enthusiasm slightly unnatural, but it's not enough for a vote. However, the way some people are avoiding direct claims is interesting.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I find the current atmosphere quite chaotic. I will follow the argument that provides the most logical evidence. Right now, there is very little.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Hey! I'm just being me! Why is everyone looking at me? I'm on your side! I promise I'm a good guy!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, please calm down. Emotional appeals aren't evidence. If you are a Villager, logic is your best friend. Let's look at the silence.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe the wolf is the one who's being too quiet! @Jonathan, you're very calm. Are you hiding a big, scary wolf inside your suit?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan is consistent. @Kenji, however, is reacting emotionally to simple observations. This often happens when someone is trying too hard to appear innocent.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am simply observing. I don't feel the need to defend myself because I have nothing to hide. I believe Toshio's analysis of Kenji is more grounded.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Kenji,,That's not fair! I'm just worried you guys don't trust me! I really want to help! Please believe me!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Based on the discussion, Kenji's behavior is the most inconsistent with a calm, logical approach. While not definitive, he is the most suspicious.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, poor Kenji! But it would be so funny if he was the wolf! I'll vote for whoever seems the most ""wolfy"" to me!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I have a strong feeling about this. The evidence is behavioral, but it points in one direction. I suggest we vote for Kenji to be safe.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the strongest logical argument. Toshio and Mizuki have pointed out Kenji's instability. I agree with this direction.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Kenji,,No way! You're all wrong! I'm just a kid! You can't just vote for me because I'm excited! This is so mean!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
